cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: EMStudio
abstract: >-
  The sovereign graph editor for the Extended Matrix: two views on the same
  data — the EM swimlane matrix, with epochs as lanes and time flowing upward,
  and the full knowledge graph with every relation visible. Web service and
  desktop application from a single codebase.
type: software
